  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blank Street\u2019s menu ranges from black coffee and espresso to flavored matchas, house lattes, cold brew drinks, and pastries. That means there is no single calorie range that represents every visit.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Blank Street Coffee Calories Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to find the exact drink or food you are considering and compare its calories and available nutrition information before you order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.poou8fn80sd1\">\n<span>\n     Matcha Is a Major Part of the Blank Street Menu\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blank Street has built a large part of its menu around matcha, with options that go well beyond a standard Matcha Latte.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Depending on availability, you may find drinks such as Blueberry Matcha, Strawberry Shortcake Matcha, Daydream Matcha, Cookies &amp; Cream Matcha, or other seasonal flavors.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These drinks should not be treated as nutritionally interchangeable.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A plain matcha drink may contain relatively few ingredients, while a flavored matcha can include milk, syrups, sauces, fruit preparations, or other additions that raise the calorie content.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the calculator to compare the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     specific matcha drink\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , rather than applying one calorie number to every matcha on the menu.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.k6mu458w71r9\">\n<span>\n     Hot and Iced Drinks Can Have Different Calories\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same drink name does not always mean the same nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blank Street\u2019s standard recipes can use different amounts of milk or other ingredients depending on whether a drink is served hot or iced. Size can change those amounts again.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, a hot latte and an iced latte may have different calorie totals even before you make any customizations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When searching the calculator, match all three details whenever possible:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Drink name + preparation + size\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That gives you a much more useful result than searching only for \u201clatte\u201d or \u201cmatcha.\u201d\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.vgvkqdw3znt1\">\n<span>\n     House Lattes Add More Than Espresso and Milk\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Signature drinks such as Pistachio Latte, Daydream Latte, Strawberries &amp; Cream Latte, and other house creations include ingredients beyond a basic espresso-and-milk latte.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Flavor syrups, chocolate, nut-based flavors, sweeteners, or specialty ingredients can make their calorie totals noticeably different from a standard latte.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are comparing a house latte with a regular latte, look at the finished drinks as separate menu items rather than assuming the difference is only flavor.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.bt8nqb2fp3pi\">\n<span>\n     Cold Brew Can Range From Simple to Rich\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Plain\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Original Cold Brew\n    </span>\n<span>\n     has a very different nutrition profile from a Cold Brew Latte or Mocha Cold Brew.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Adding milk changes calories and macros, while chocolate or other flavor ingredients can increase the total further.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This makes cold brew a useful example of why the name of the coffee base alone does not tell you the nutrition of the finished drink.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Choose the complete preparation shown in the calculator.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.h1zel193iu8l\">\n<span>\n     A Pastry Can Add More Calories Than the Coffee\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blank Street also serves pastries and baked goods, including items such as croissants, pain au chocolat, cinnamon buns, and other bakery choices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order food with your drink, calculate them together.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Americano + croissant\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Flavored matcha + cinnamon bun\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     represent very different total orders even though both are simply \u201ccoffee shop breakfast\u201d choices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the meal builder to combine the drink and food instead of checking each calorie number in isolation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.bl9visdbfcin\">\n<span>\n     How to Get the Most Useful Result\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start by searching for the exact item name. Then check whether the calculator lists separate hot, iced, or flavored versions.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order more than one item, add everything to your meal total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Remember that customizations can change the result. Switching milk, adding flavor, adjusting sweetness, or choosing a different size can make the drink you receive different from the standard recipe used for published nutrition information.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.r7iu75bu2s7j\">\n<span>\n     Blank Street Coffee Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Blank Street Coffee?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Blank Street Matcha Latte?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is Blank Street cold brew low in calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does changing milk affect Blank Street drink calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Blank Street pastries included in drink calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.p9hm8wnz32yq\">\n<span>\n     About the Blank Street Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Blank Street Coffee nutrition information\n    </span>\n<span>\n     across coffee, matcha, house lattes, cold brew, tea, and bakery items so you can compare individual products or calculate a complete coffee-shop order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Nutrition values represent standard menu preparations. Drink size, milk choice, flavors, seasonal recipes, regional menus, and customizations can change the nutrition of the final product.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "How many calories are in Blank Street Coffee?",
      "a": "It depends on the drink. Black coffee, espresso, and Americano can contain very few calories, while milk-based drinks, flavored matchas, house lattes, and pastries can contain considerably more."
    },
    {
      "q": "How many calories are in a Blank Street Matcha Latte?",
      "a": "Calories depend on whether the Matcha Latte is hot or iced, the serving size, milk, and any added flavors. Use the calculator above to select the closest version to your order."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is Blank Street cold brew low in calories?",
      "a": "Plain cold brew can be very low in calories. Cold Brew Lattes, mocha versions, and flavored cold brew drinks contain additional ingredients and should be checked separately."
    },
